"""BUILD overlay for @hpipm (http_archive).

hpipm has no Bazel build of its own. The source-file list below is
transcribed from hpipm's own CMakeLists.txt defaults, which
ocs2_sqp/hpipm_catkin/CMakeLists.txt does not override: TARGET=AVX (hpipm's
own default -- note this is independent of BLASFEO's own TARGET, which is
GENERIC; hpipm's TARGET only selects which of its *own* ipm_core aux sources
to build), REF_BLAS=0, USE_C99_MATH=ON, RUNTIME_CHECKS=ON.
"""

